<item><title>Namibia sets aside N$26m to pay drought-relief suppliers</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/na/namibia-sets-aside-n-26m-to-pay-drought-relief-suppliers-de1978/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/na/namibia-sets-aside-n-26m-to-pay-drought-relief-suppliers-de1978/</guid><category>Namibia</category><description>The mid-year budget review directs the money to transporters and suppliers who delivered aid during the previous drought but remain unpaid.</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 06:44:10 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/na.jpg" length="33196" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/na.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
